{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcabbit - Swing-focused 2D Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D platformer where you use swinging with two hooks to dash through athletic stages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Grappling \u00d7 Swing Platformer where you sprint with two hooks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content: About 100 challenges (sections to clear from checkpoint \u2192 next checkpoint)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel: Designed for quick retries so you can easily repeat attempts and clearly feel yourself improving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound: An electronic soundtrack where effects and gimmicks sync with the BGM</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visuals: High-contrast neon visuals make routes intuitive and easy to read</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All you do is &quot;connect&quot; and &quot;flick&quot; the hooks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet deep controls\u2014every action comes from the two hooks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use pendulum-like swings and leap with centrifugal force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910660/extras/85596a7d26198e7f1093f402eee6e571.poster.avif?t=1770739480\" aria-label=\"arcabbit core actions\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910660/extras/85596a7d26198e7f1093f402eee6e571.webm?t=1770739480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910660/extras/85596a7d26198e7f1093f402eee6e571.mp4?t=1770739480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge a variety of gimmicks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages are filled with diverse gimmicks, and all you can use are the hooks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of your hooks and conquer every stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910660/extras/a869a6ec71955042d85b39803fb97f57.poster.avif?t=1770739480\" aria-label=\"arcabbit varied gimmicks\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910660/extras/a869a6ec71955042d85b39803fb97f57.webm?t=1770739480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910660/extras/a869a6ec71955042d85b39803fb97f57.mp4?t=1770739480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-paced, repeat retries!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until you get used to the unique controls, you may run out of steam again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints are placed frequently, so you can restart right away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910660/extras/5bc2e8734dd4aa9d17afdfb3ec78727f.poster.avif?t=1770739480\" aria-label=\"arcabbit quick retry\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910660/extras/5bc2e8734dd4aa9d17afdfb3ec78727f.webm?t=1770739480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910660/extras/5bc2e8734dd4aa9d17afdfb3ec78727f.mp4?t=1770739480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About video posts/streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions, whether commercial or non-commercial, and no individual contact is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We warmly welcome you sharing your play experience.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level 1 Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910660/8778f38b93f5a9bc101cac8b19bae830ebc8b7d1.jpg"},{"name":"Level 2 Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910660/c2b7ad37094e9ece20ca8e2311e0ecffa8b9fa9c.jpg"},{"name":"Level 3 Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910660/f41ccbc8b6edfa4d87f85cdfe8f71d864d6b206a.jpg"},{"name":"Level 4 Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910660/2ba8577f862468db41f35b9d86a48a643a3e394c.jpg"},{"name":"Level 5 Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910660/0e56898e32f7d522d1dbbb37afe8e61e6531c0d2.jpg"},{"name":"Level 6 Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910660/74be76bd35e81a4e2e4194114c894b96e808dea1.jpg"},{"name":"Level 7 Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910660/5c596bbd98a7a42ca2c1027d0b5a885306aceeeb.jpg"},{"name":"Level 8 Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910660/07c85d4ad597990bfd50ff50725e2b516c3ce33e.jpg"},{"name":"Level 9 Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910660/26222643266bab8315515bd80f0193bc8d9f07fa.jpg"},{"name":"Level 10 Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910660/88a56fda7d1f9ebc0fd1716ecb91aa54ec5f2b79.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910660?t=1770739480","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910660?t=1770739480","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910660/d97d59fc3d7086eb0f3766ebe482c8db954a1830/capsule